Subject: [PATCH] Fix PELT pruning with minimum segment lengths

---
 src/ruptures/detection/pelt.py |  83 ++++++++++++++------------
 tests/test_pelt_min_size.py    | 103 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
